@@ -98,7 +98,9 @@ public static partial class CarMapper
 }
 ```
 
-If Mapperly is unable to inline a user-implemented method, `RMG068` is reported.
+If Mapperly is unable to inline a user-implemented method, the warning `RMG068` is reported.
+To prevent unintended client-side evaluation, this warning can be promoted to an error
+(e.g. via `dotnet_diagnostic.RMG068.severity = error` in the `.editorconfig`).
 Non-inlined method invocations can lead to more data being loaded than necessary.
 
 Ordering and aggregating collections can also be implemented with user-implemented mapping methods:
